---
import ContentLayout from '../layouts/ContentLayout.astro';
---

<ContentLayout
  title="Software & Apps | Fluxology, Inc."
  description="Fluxology, Inc. develops and publishes its own software products, including iOS applications and supporting web tools."
  eyebrow="Software publishing"
  heading="Independent software products from Fluxology, Inc."
  intro="Fluxology, Inc. develops and publishes its own applications and digital tools. Software is a direct corporate activity: we are building products for end users, not offering contract app-development services."
>
  <section>
    <h2>Current software activity</h2>
    <p>
      Software development is active during Fluxology's current foundation period. The company is building iOS
      applications for future App Store distribution alongside web-based research, comparison and workflow tools.
      Product scope, support material and privacy disclosures are finalized before each public release.
    </p>

    <div class="content-card-grid">
      <article class="content-card">
        <h3>Office Scout</h3>
        <p class="content-meta">Active development · decision-support software</p>
        <p>
          Office Scout organizes office-listing research around verified all-in cost, access and transit details,
          fit scoring, listing changes and a personal review workflow. A supporting web dashboard is already used
          for research and product development.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="content-card">
        <h3>Fluxology Deals</h3>
        <p class="content-meta">Active development · deal research and comparison</p>
        <p>
          Fluxology Deals organizes product searches across multiple categories, preserves listing history and
          distinguishes verified landed-cost information from unresolved shipping or pricing data. A supporting
          web dashboard is used for ongoing research and product development.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Publishing model</h2>
    <p>
      Apps and related intellectual property are developed and published by Fluxology, Inc. The corporation is the
      legal entity responsible for product distribution, customer support and applicable product policies. The
      proposed trade, fabrication and homestead operating names described elsewhere on this site are separate
      future operating lines of the same corporation; they are not the publisher of the software products.
    </p>
    <div class="content-callout">
      <strong>Product support:</strong> <a href="/support/">fluxology.ca/support/</a><br />
      <strong>Privacy:</strong> <a href="/privacy/">fluxology.ca/privacy/</a><br />
      <strong>General contact:</strong> <a href="mailto:info@fluxology.ca">info@fluxology.ca</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Release status</h2>
    <p>
      The applications described here are in development and are not represented as currently available on the
      App Store. When an app is released, Fluxology will publish the applicable support information, privacy
      disclosures and store links on this site.
    </p>
  </section>
</ContentLayout>
